        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9514999b-766c-4eef-8e42-9b16279bebdb).Image",
        "Description": "Good day, 47. Kohn&apos;s reached out and is requesting our services for a third time. Seems that the investigation surrounding the law firm is tightening too much for Mr. Kohn&apos;s liking. We&apos;ll have to take out Ford Jr., who plans to sell sensitive documents to authorities. And Sutton is finishing the Ruby Red investigation, and plans on divulging her findings at the party. Also, it seems the Dexy in Bangkok was a decoy, so take her out for good this time. Pam said Ken Morgan is dead, total liar.",
